config BR2_PACKAGE_PLDRIFT
	bool "pldrift"
	help
	  Logs the PL timestamp counter from the OCM ring buffer against
	  CLOCK_MONOTONIC_RAW and CLOCK_REALTIME for drift measurement.

	  Also installs adcmon (ADC monitor), ocmsoak, and adcburst, which
	  captures every 20 kHz sample for a fixed time into RAM and then
	  writes it to InfluxDB v2 as line protocol over HTTP.

	  adcscope streams a live lab view to InfluxDB: per-cycle RMS,
	  frequency and power, a block-averaged waveform, trip register
	  changes, and full-rate captures around trips or a manual trigger.
